                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.7131/108: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Rumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Wilson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-08-05T01:00:00+01:44">August 5, 1930—1
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 9:32 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>30. Legation’s 29, August 4, 4 p.m., paragraph 2. Rumanian Government now agrees
                    to’ accept Department substitute subdivision (<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>),
                    article 4.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
